  "invariants": [
    "Email and multiple-email map to existing NXS_TEXTFIELD and reuse the same real NSTextField provider, focus, original model transactions, native keys and engine clipboard commands.",
    "Existing guarded internal selection accessors support email; public JavaScript selection properties stay null and setSelectionRange still throws InvalidStateError. No replacement caret, editor, formatter or key policy is added.",
    "A guarded original Firefox input-value notification calls its original method first, then reuses paint-only invalidation for the native owner. It covers inactive ordinary and email fields.",
    "Chromium reuses its existing before-paint control binder for eligible single-line text/password inputs. The same guarded effective-appearance reader serves lists and text; input-owned controls use the existing renderer watcher and real native input path.",
    "An independent real native editor supplies expected key results and full images, including read-only initial focus and selection. No native UI library code is changed.",
    "Shared provider/loader/shim stay at API 1/584. Original browser address bars, toolbars and tabs remain; future requested UI changes belong to optional app patches."
  ]
